<title>USA: United Dominion Realty sees gain from sale.</title>
<headline>United Dominion Realty sees gain from sale.</headline>
<dateline>RICHMOND, Va. 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Dominion Realty Trust Inc said Monday it expects to record a gain of about $500,000 on the sale of the Meadowdale Shopping Center in Richmond.</p>
<p>United Dominion said it sold the 172,000-square-foot center to Meadowdale Realty LLC for about $5.3 million.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
